      "content": "i get what u mean about the theory vs reality thing, but it feels like u're making a pretty strong case that the \"theory\" is basically irrelevant when it comes to real people. if the policy ends up hurting the very people it's supposed to help, isn't it just a bad policy? regardless of what the textbook says?",
